    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不到半个月就要开启人生首野</span></p><span></span><p><span>有点慌了</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>萨洛蒙运动市场部、小麦百公里创始人 ：小麦老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线</span></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> intro</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a>水袋包携带与赛事安全探讨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:0</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;强制装备解析与重要性</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a>装备与补给策略</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a> 萨洛蒙越野马甲：多功能水袋包的全面解析</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a>水袋包使用技巧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1367">22:47</a> 雨衣与保暖毯：越野跑装备的实战考量</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a>个性化穿搭</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1827">30:27</a> 越野跑装备与袜子选择要点</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2051">34:11</a> 五指袜与五指鞋：健康与运动的双重优势</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2131">35:31</a> 越野跑鞋与袜子更换技巧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> 越野赛装备与防护技巧分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 越野跑鞋设计与磨损分析</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2819">46:59</a> 越野跑装备与安全细节探讨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3034">50:34</a> 跑步从坚持到信仰的转变</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>特别感谢：小羊老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>快点解除封印！</span></p>]]></description>
